  "finalText": "I rebooked all 8 passengers from the cancelled ZX 400. Everyone kept their cabin, each booking stayed together, and ZX 400 now shows no one left to rebook.\n\n| Booking | Passengers | Cabin | New flight |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| HZ4K7Q | Jan, Maja and Luka Horvat | Economy | ZX 404, 3 Nov 07:00 |\n| RS2M9D | Elena and Marco Rossi | Business | ZX 406, 3 Nov 10:00 |\n| NV8P2L | Anna Novak | Economy | ZX 402, 2 Nov 18:00 |\n| BG5J3R | Tom Berger | Economy | ZX 402, 2 Nov 18:00 |\n| LD9C6W | Sara Lind | Business | ZX 402, 2 Nov 18:00 |\n\nTwo bookings couldn't go on the earliest flight, ZX 402:\n- **Horvat family:** ZX 402 had only 2 free Economy seats for 3 people, so they're on ZX 404, the next flight with room.\n- **Rossi couple:** ZX 402 had only 1 free Business seat and ZX 404 had none, so they're on ZX 406.\n\nThese moves filled ZX 402's remaining Economy and Business seats and ZX 404's remaining Economy seats.",
